  :id                    "sensation/cycloid"
  :canonical             "cycloid"
  :synonyms              ()
  :examples              ("From ch-advanced-13-differential-geometry.book.slatl: The **brachistochrone** is the curve of fastest descent under gravity — the path a bead slides down in minimum time. It's a cycloid, found by the calculus of variations.")
